        "recovery_help" to "Connect exactly one FM-1 in ROM download mode (4C4A:8057 / WL82 UBOOT1.00) and grant USB access. A black screen is normal in this mode. If firmware still responds, connect its MIDI port and use Enter download mode. With m-bootloader, hold REC at power-on. Stock firmware has no universal recovery key combination. If nothing appears on USB, a USB_KEY hardware tool or a second instrument running M-Unbricker may be needed. This build cannot force that mode through a plain cable. Charge the instrument and keep USB power stable. Never format the recovery device. Download and select official V15 in the library before preparing recovery. Unknown or damaged bootloaders are refused; backup remains available. Backups survive app restarts, but uninstalling or clearing app data deletes them. Export your copy. Firmware recovery can affect saved sounds and settings; it does not restore lost presets.",
